<title>USA: IPALCO seeks new nuclear policies.</title>
<headline>IPALCO seeks new nuclear policies.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPALCO Enterprises Inc joined two consumer activist groups Monday in calling for changes in nuclear regulatory policy.</p>
<p>IPALCO, along with Public Citizen Inc and the Citizens Action Coalition of Indiana Inc, filed a joint statement calling for tougher financial standards and the elimination of regulatory subsidies for nuclear power licensees.</p>
<p>The statement is a response to the Nuclear Regulatory Commission's statement on the deregulation of the electric utility industry.</p>
<p>IPALCO is a multi-state energy holding company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
